# dist/ is generated by `node tools/sdlc-lint/cli.mjs emit` from the plugins/ SSOT
# and committed, because none of the three hosts has an install-time build step —
# every one of them installs from a checked-out tree, including a feature branch.
#
# `linguist-generated` collapses it in review diffs, where it is noise: the change
# worth reading is the one in plugins/. It stays fully diffable on request, which
# matters when the change worth reading IS the transform.
#
# A conflict here is resolved by re-running the emitter, never by hand — the same
# rule the vault's _moc-changes.md follows.
dist/** linguist-generated=true
